--
Conversion-level gate for std::regex construction: the body of the
_Compiler recursive-descent parser must be present (a `$tmp` of
_M_disjunction exists only when its body was converted).  In the
vacuous layouts described in test.desc the _Compiler constructor was
bodiless and none of the _M_* compiler members were even instantiated.
